 ### [AdaBoost Volume Classification](12549-adaboost-volume-classification.md)
-An interactive, data-driven method for multi-class segmentation of volumetric data using a framework of Error Correcting Output Codes (ECOC) and Discrete AdaBoost classifiers. It solves the problem of classifying multiple regions of interest on demand without requiring preprocessing or complex optimization procedures. Unlike graph cuts or random walker methods, it avoids segmentation dependencies among neighboring voxels, making it suitable for real-time applications and handling thinned or complex structures.
